{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Accounova 是一款將複雜記帳簡化的理財 App，特別適合希望快速記錄支出並管理多重帳戶的用戶。它透過人工智能技術，讓用戶僅需一句話或一張圖片即可完成記帳，大幅降低日常開支追蹤的時間成本。目前正值限時免費期間，是體驗這款高效工具的最佳時機。</p>\n\n<h2>多元智能記錄方式</h2>\n<p>用戶可透過語音、拍照或文字輸入來記錄消費。說一句「咖啡六塊」即自動填滿金額與類別；掃描收據能識別商家與金額；手動輸入亦仅需兩步。App 支援多重帳本、預算設定及 iCloud 私密同步，無需帳號即可本地儲存數據。統計功能提供日曆視圖與小工具，幫助直觀掌握每月趨勢與分類花費，兼顧隱私保護與使用便利性。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Accounova</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T06:24:00.803041+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}